{
  "_comment": "Pod eval fixtures for the Action Envelope. Each scenario feeds diagnostics through Envelope.AdmissibleSet and asserts that key actions are admissible (includes) or not (excludes) on that machine. Run by tests/PodEval. Grounded in Diagnostics.cs field shapes.",
